# Latest upstream Helm chart versions for packages used by cantrellr/k8s-mystical-mesh.
#
# Format:
#   repo_alias|repo_url|chart|version
#
# Purpose:
#   Use this list to download newer chart packages for upgrade testing.
#   Do not replace the mesh-pinned list without also validating values files,
#   image lists, CRDs, and upgrade notes in k8s-mystical-mesh.
#
# Notes:
#   - Rancher is intentionally left at 2.14.2 because k8s-mystical-mesh already
#     references rancher-2.14.2.tgz. Rancher's GitHub latest release page currently
#     resolves to v2.14.1, so this list avoids a version downgrade.
#   - Trident operator is intentionally left at 100.2602.1 because that is the
#     highest version referenced by k8s-mystical-mesh. Current NetApp 26.02 docs
#     show 100.2602.0, so verify the Helm repository before switching this pin.
#   - mongo-express remains manual until a reliable upstream chart source is confirmed.

bitnamicharts|oci://registry-1.docker.io/bitnamicharts|cert-manager|1.5.15
metallb|https://metallb.github.io/metallb|metallb|0.16.1
netapp-trident|https://netapp.github.io/trident-helm-chart|trident-operator|100.2602.1
netapp-trident-protect|https://netapp.github.io/trident-protect-helm-chart|trident-protect|100.2606.0
bitnamicharts|oci://registry-1.docker.io/bitnamicharts|contour|21.1.5
prometheus-community|https://prometheus-community.github.io/helm-charts|kube-prometheus-stack|87.5.1
argoproj|https://argoproj.github.io/argo-helm|argo-cd|10.1.1
nats|https://nats-io.github.io/k8s/helm/charts|nats|2.14.2
rancher-latest|https://releases.rancher.com/server-charts/latest|rancher|2.14.2
rocketchat|https://rocketchat.github.io/helm-charts|rocketchat|7.0.0
mongodb|https://mongodb.github.io/helm-charts|mongodb-kubernetes|1.9.1
portainer|https://portainer.github.io/k8s/|portainer|239.4.0
longhorn|https://charts.longhorn.io|longhorn|1.12.0

# Manual/staged until upstream chart source is confirmed:
# manual|unknown|mongo-express|6.5.2
